<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Tagin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Pilemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">PILEMONNYI Paul gv Siti jinam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pilemon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pilem</para>
  <para style="mt1">PILEMONNYI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Paul gv Siti Jinam</para>
  <para style="imt">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="ip">Pilemon kristan lo amin yunam akobv rito, kolosae gv gvrja lo mvngjwngnv akobv rinvgo okv Onesimus vnam nyira agv atuv. Soogv nyira angv si ninyigv atu gv ara lokv gvngv kilin laku, okv hv Paul gvlo aala lvko lvkobv tvvkurkaarwk minsula rito, oogv patwk lo doonv ngam. Paul lokv gvngv, Onesimus kristan ako bv ritoku. <char style="bk">Paul gv sitiv Pilemonnyi </char> ninyigv nyira am adwnaba laku naakur dukubv siti tago jilwk la rito, vbv Paul yvvnyi jikur dukubv ridung bvdw, okv um vbvching ninyia mvngnga jilaku nyira bv umbonyikv vla naarwk sitwk kumabv vbvritola kristan achiboru yabvku naarwk sidukubv lvkto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arwng lokv darlinnam</para>
  <para style="io1">Mintamchonam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pilemon lvgabv hartvkinu nam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Onesimus lvgabv minjinam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lvknyunglvknya kunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Paul lokv, Jisu Kristo lvgabv pachipatwk doonv, okv ngonugv achiboru Timoti lokv—</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Ngonugv ajin okv ribamdakbam nam ajin Pilemon, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol 4:17</ref> </char></note> okv nonugv naam lo gvrja ribusila kaarwksinam vdw, okv ngonugv anyibormv Appia, okv ngonu ribamnam ajin sipai Archippu:<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Ngonugv Pwknvyarnv Abu okv Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv anyuaya okv sarsopoyo ngv nonu gvlo jilwk yilaka.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philemon gv paknam okv mvngjwngnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Achiboru Pilemon, ngo aludwkibv, noogv amin am laala okv ngoogv Pwknvyarnv gvlo umbonyikv vla kumlwk jidunv. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Vkvlgabv nonu vdwgv Pwknvyarnv gv nyi mvnwng nga pakjinam lvgabv okv Jisu lo nonugv mvngjwngnam am ngo tvvpa doodunv. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Ngonugv kristo gvlo turnam am akin dula kumbamjobam dubv boktalwknam sum mvngjwngnv gobv ridula arwngrungbv tvvpikaapi lakdu bv ngo kumnam si kumdunv. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Noogv paknamv, ayanam achiboru, ngo gvlo kairungnv himpu am okv mingtvmirunam am achialvbv laalwk jidu! no Pwknvyarnv gv nyi mvnwng gv haapok ka habiatata motoku.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Onesimus gv lvgabv lvbunam nam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Vkvlvkwngbv ngo chvrv rungdubv, kristo lo noogv achiboru bv rinam lokv, ogu risvdw ngo nam orto jila dunv. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Vbvrijvka ogulvgavbolo ngo nam pakdunv, nam ngo lvbula minam yangv si hv alvyagobo mvngdunv. Vbvrijvka Paul ngo svbv ridu, Jisu kristo gv nyitampingko bv ridu, okv vjvka ninyigv amin lvgabv pachipatwk lo doodunv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jisu Kristo gv nyitompingko, okv vjvka ninyigv amin lo pachipatwk lo doodunv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nyikom ako, okv vjaka Jisu gv Kristo gv amin lo pachipatwk doodunv.</char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol 4:9</ref> </char></note> Vkvlvgabv onesimus gv peelvbv ngo nam lvbula mindunv, ngoogv atunvgv kuunyilo bv kristo lo ridunv; pachipatwk arwng lo doori hoka ngo ninyigv dowjwklo gv abu bv ripv kunv. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Alu gulo no lvgabv oguguchin richindakchin mato, vbvritola vjak alv rungbv rilakvnglak duku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek gaambv Onesimus vnamv “rinvvngnv arinyachokv.”</char></note> no gvbvka okv ngo gvbvka anyi gvbv alvjvnv gobv riduku.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Vjak ninyia lvkodv no gvlo ngo vngkur mogv ikunv okv ngoogv haapok vka ninyigv lvkobv vngming gvvdunv. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Ngoogv lvkobv ninyia so doomu nwngto nvi, Gamlv gv lvgalo ngoogv pachipatwk doi dvdv so, vkvlvgavbolo noogv mooku hoka ninyia modurvngdur yadubv. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Vbvrijvka, ngam ridurnam lvgabv ngo nam raitongtong nwngmado; Vbvyamabvdv, no lvgabv ngo noogv mvngnam bv um rimu nwngdunv. Vkvlvgabv no mvnglwk suma bolo ngo oguguchin rimu nyoya madunv.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Onesimus gv achukgo no gvlo gvngv kiyu namsi alvyago aakur lakula doobwng minggv yajikuladv vkvlvgabv kiku nvgoi. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Okv vjak ninyi nyira mvngchik bvkuma, vbvritola nyira am alv yasin nvbvku: Kristo lo hv ayanam achiboru ngvku. Hv ngam vdwgo pakdudw vkvgo namka kaiyago pakri nvpv, nyira bvkula okv Ahtu Jisu gvlo achiboru bvku. Anyi baabwng ngv nyira bv mvngma bv achiboru bv Ahtu Jisu gvlo ritoka!<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Vkvlvgabv no ngam ajin bv mvngdu bolo, ngam umbonyikv vla laarwk sinam aingbv ninyia laarwk sutoka. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Vdwlo ninyi ogugo rimur pvdw vmalo ogugo jikurrikur svgo doodudw um ngo gvlo sapnumbunam am saplwk tvka. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Soka, ngo atunvgv laak lokv si lvkdunv: <char style="it">Paul ngo nam dorji riku. </char> (Nam ngo lvko mvngpa dadubv rima svngv, vbvrijvka, no atubongv ngoogv rigurriyin nvnga mvngpa ridu.) <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Vkvlvga, ngokv achiboru, kaju ngokv tongbv mvnglwk gvrila Ahtu gv amin lo ritoka; kristo lo achiboru bv ngam habiatata jitoka.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Ngo mvngjwngdu, ngoogv lvknam sum, oguaingbv ngo tvvka pvdw no vbvching rire—nam chinrungdu ngo minam dvdv sumka um no kaiyasin bvka riri nvpv. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Gaamgodv mindvdu, ngo lvgabv karchung lo ako mvpv jilaka, ngo mvngdu nonu mvnwng gv kumnam am Pwknvyarnv ngv tvvlaku okv ngam svbv nonu gvlo aakur modu kobv rireku.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumnyungbv kumrwklwtaknam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Epapras, ngoogv lvkobv pachipatwk lo Jisu kristo gv amin bv doonv, vdwka tulwk minggv gvrila ninyi gvbvka nam kumrwklwtak nama jilwk jidunv, <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Nyim 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Nyim 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Tim 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2Tim 4:11</ref> </char></note> okv ngo gv ribamdakbam nam Mark, Aristarkas, Demas, okv Luk bunu vdwka vbv jilwk minggvdu.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Nonu mvnwng lo Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv anyuaya ngv dooming gvilaka.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
